  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Enjoy ultimate convenience at this newly updated Grove by the Sea home, just a 2-minute walk from the beach and heated pool. Includes 4 Bikes!<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Welcome to Sunny Day by Kismet Properties of 30A!<br><br><br><br>Discover your ideal 30A vacation at this newly updated 3-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom home nestled in the picturesque Grove by the Sea community. The home features a brand-new outdoor oasis with an expanded deck and patio, perfect for relaxing after a day in the sun. With the beach and community pool just a quick two-minute walk away, plus 4 bikes included, this home offers ultimate convenience and comfort for your group.<br><br><br><br>Key Features:<br><br>•\tNewly updated interior and brand-new outdoor space<br><br>•\t3 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms<br><br>•\tSleeps 8<br><br>•\t2-minute walk to the beach<br><br>•\tAcross from the pool<br><br>•\tIncludes 4 bikes<br><br>•\tGas Grill<br><br>•\tFully Equipped Kitchen <br><br><br><br>Sleeping Arrangements:<br><br>•\tPrimary (1st Floor) - King Bed - Private Ensuite Bathroom (Shower/Tub)<br><br>•\tGuest (2nd Floor) - King Bed - Hall Bathroom (Shower/Tub)<br><br>•\tGuest (2nd Floor) - 2 Twin/Full Bunk Beds - Hall Bathroom (Shower/Tub)<br><br><br><br>Community Amenities:<br><br>•\t2 Pools (One Seasonally Heated March 15- April 15)<br><br>•\tTennis Court <br><br><br><br>Beach Access:<br><br>•\t2-minute walk to the beach.<br><br>•\tS. Andalusia Beach Access <br><br><br><br>Location:<br><br>Located in the highly sought-after Grove by the Sea community, known for its charming, picturesque setting and convenient access to the best of Seagrove Beach and 30A.<br><br><br><br>Guest Access:<br><br>Guests are given a unique door code that is active for the duration of their stay.<br><br><br><br>Interaction with Guests:<br><br>We respect your privacy but can always assist you with any questions or recommendations.<br><br><br><br>Parking:<br><br>•\tParking for 3 Vehicles <br><br>•\tNo Boats, Trailers, or U-Hauls<br><br>•\tNO STREET PARKING <br><br><br><br>House Rules:<br><br>•\tNo smoking<br><br>•\tNO PETS<br><br>•\tNo parties or events<br><br>•\tMust be 25 or older and staying at the property for the entire stay.<br><br>•\tThe primary guest is required to sign the Kismet Properties Renter’s Agreement.<br><br>•\tThe Primary guest is required to upload a copy of their photo ID.<br><br><br><br>Check-In/Check-Out:<br><br>Check-in: 4:00 PM Check-out: 10:00 AM<br><br><br><br>CANCELATION POLICY:<br><br>Guest receives 100% (less $250.00 cancellation fee) if cancellation occurs more than 60 days before arrival; Guest receives 50% (less $250.00 cancellation fee) if cancellation occurs more than 30 days before arrival; No refunds within 30 days of arrival.",
